  "notes": [
    "Blackwater breaker cues are louder and easier to follow around corners, with useful warning at about 30 metres and a smooth fade beyond that. Activated breakers still go silent.",
    "Hunters in both levels now have dedicated positional recorded footfalls. They carry farther through the maze, grow louder as the hunter approaches and follow actual movement rather than an idle timer.",
    "Footsteps pause cleanly in solo, avoid false thumps on network position corrections, and reuse a bounded voice pool for up to four hunters. Existing growls, chase audio and hunting rules are retained.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Everyone in a co-op group should update."
  ],
